{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52320","headline":"诗（幷序） 八十一 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 八十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"死王羡活鼠，宁及寻常人。\n得官何须喜，失职何须忧。\n不可将财觅，不可智力求。\n傥来可柜突（张改作「柜藏」），□（张补「任」，项疑「运」）去不可留。\n（二句戴校「傥来不可拒，俄去不可留。\n」）任来还任去，智（戴、项校「知」）命何须愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}